#: ../../source/docs/common-simulation.rst:5 a50d902eac0f4f8196f66e526282ff38
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simulation.rst:7 df436176ce2d437f984005e0cf0356cf
msgid ""
":ref:`dev:simulation-2` allows for safe testing of experimental code and "
"settings, and can help you practice using your Ground Station without having"
" to leave your desk."
msgstr ":ref:`dev:simulation-2` 允许安全测试实验性代码和设置，并可帮助您在不离开桌面的情况下练习使用地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simulation.rst:13 200d5481a790428bacbb998a81ace2ab
msgid "Crashing simulated planes is a lot cheaper than crashing real ones!"
msgstr "摔坏仿真飞机比摔坏真实飞机便宜得多！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simulation.rst:16 5a4dae47dc0445ec84459a574ffd671a
msgid ""
"Most users should choose the :ref:`Software In The Loop (SITL) simulator "
"<dev:sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` (dev wiki) as it can simulate "
"Copter, Plane or Rover without the need for any vehicle hardware, and can be"
" run on Linux, Windows and Mac OSX. It is also the easiest form of "
"simulation to set up."
msgstr ""
"大多数用户应选择 :ref:`软件在环（SITL）仿真器 <dev:sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` （开发者"
" wiki），因为它无需任何飞行器硬件即可仿真 Copter、Plane 或 Rover，并可在 Linux、Windows 和 Mac OSX "
"上运行。它也是最易于搭建的仿真形式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-simulation.rst:21 81d6ea647f52488aa07b0a5f25fe0b46
msgid ""
"Some users may wish to fly \"virtually\" with their hardware in the loop.  "
"This is possible with :ref:`Simulation on Hardware <dev:sim-on-hardware>`"
msgstr "部分用户可能希望在硬件在环的情况下「虚拟」飞行。这可通过 :ref:`硬件仿真 <dev:sim-on-hardware>` 实现"
